    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$-4+8=4$; level 4.",
      "worked": "Ground level is $0$, so 4 floors below ground is $-4$. Going up 8 levels adds $8$.\n$$\\begin{align*}-4+8&=4\\end{align*}$$\nHis office is at level 4.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
